{"id":"888932bbbe1a9581","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-essvar.md","title":"Essential variables","display":"df-essvar — Essential variables","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-essvar","aliases":["27-df-essvar"],"display":"df-essvar — Essential variables","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.8 Definition 1.23","source_printed_pages":"30","source_pdf_pages":"54","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-with-zero-arity-extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-essvar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-essvar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-essvar — Essential variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.8 Definition 1.23"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"30"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"54"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-with-zero-arity-extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;(x_j=y_j))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;(x_j=y_j))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此定义对零元函数也合法，Ess 为空；对正元数，与两个第 i 位 cofactor 不同完全等价。避免 n=0 时出现未定义的 B^(−1)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ess}(f)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;(x_j=y_j))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1053,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-essvar|df-essvar — Essential variables]]"},{"id":"4bf511a4d3b45272","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i\\in[n]$；见 [[27-df-boolderivative]]、[[27-df-essvar]]、[[27-df-constfunc]]。"},{"id":"7774dfe23c403fa3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ess}(f)$ (essential-coordinate set, see [[27-df-essvar]])"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}